# OpenRazer 3.12.4: route both 00c3 polling writes through 0x1f.
# Hardware capture confirms 0xff times out for mode 1; 0x1f acknowledges both.
# Validate input/acks, serialize the pair, and propagate failures without replay.
# Extended polling read replies declare size 1 while storing the rate in arg[1].
# Apply after openrazer-driver-transport.patch.
